{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>I made sport.</b> I mocked — as in ״כִּי הִתְעַלַּלְתְּ בִּי״ (Numbers 22), ״הֲלֹא כַּאֲשֶׁר הִתְעוֹלֵל בָּהֶם״ (I Samuel 6) — said of Egypt. It is not a term of act and deeds, for if so it should have been written עוֹלַלְתִּי, as in ״וְעוֹלֵל לָמוֹ כַּאֲשֶׁר עוֹלַלְתָּ לִי״ (Lamentations 1), ״אֲשֶׁר עוֹלַל לִי״ (there)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:19.598507234Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}